You focus on a target zone of radius 2 to make up to 2 corrosive seeds appear.

At talent levels 3 and 5, the number of corrosive seeds you can plant will increase by 1.

The first seed will appear at the center of the target zone, while others will appear at random spots.

Each seed lasts {{ctl|12|5|8.5}} turns and will explode when a hostile creature walks over it, knocking the creature back and dealing {{ctmd|20|290}} Acid damage within radius 1.

The damage will increase with your Mindpower.
